    "title": "ACU Hits Road to Take On In-State Opponents UT Arlington, Tarleton State - NewsBreak",
    "text": "18 hours ago ARLINGTON, Texas - Abilene Christian women's basketball stays in-state as it begins a three-game road swing this week versus UT Arlington and Tarleton State. The Wildcats make the day trip to take on the Lady Mavs at 6:30 p.m. Thursday before closing out their I-20 Rivalry season series with the Texans at 2 p.m. Saturday in Stephenville. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
